<title>HONG KONG: Salomon names Asia-Pac infrastructure analyst.</title>
<headline>Salomon names Asia-Pac infrastructure analyst.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers announced on Wednesday the expansion of its Asia-Pacific equity research department with the appointment of Cathy Chang as regional infrastructure analyst, to be based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Chang previously covered the infrastructure sector at Schroders Securities Asia.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
